Feature: §9 F — the array-decomposition length guard panics at runtime (ruling 5), both routes

  Scenario: decomp_len_mismatch (own-native — [1,2] cannot fill three targets)
    Given source = "cases/decomp_len_mismatch.tks"
    When built and run
    Then it traps
    And stderr pattern = "array decomposition: expected exactly 3 elements"

  Scenario: decomp_len_mismatch (C route)
    Given source = "cases/decomp_len_mismatch.tks"
    Given env = ["TEKO_BACKEND=c"]
    When built and run
    Then it traps
    And stderr pattern = "array decomposition: expected exactly 3 elements"
